 "reply": "```latex\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6, font=\\sffamily]\n  % barrel of the water gun\n  \\draw[thick] (0,0.3) rectangle (6,1.3);\n  % water inside the barrel\n  \\dotregion{1.05}{0.35}{5.95}{1.25}\n\n  % piston at the back of the barrel\n  \\fill[black!60] (0.8,0.3) rectangle (1.05,1.3);\n  % piston rod to the trigger\n  \\draw[thick] (0.9,0.8) -- (-1,0.8);\n  \\fill (0.9,0.8) circle (2pt);\n\n  % force on the trigger, label above the arrow\n  \\draw[->, thick] (-2.4,0.8) -- (-1,0.8) node[above, pos=0.5] {$5.0$ N};\n  \\draw[thin] (-2.4,0.8) -- (-2.4,-0.6) node[below] {trigger};\n\n  % narrow nozzle with stopper\n  \\draw[thick] (6,0.55) rectangle (6.8,1.05);\n  \\fill[black!50] (6.8,0.5) rectangle (7,1.1);\n  \\fill (6.9,0.8) circle (2pt);\n\n  % labels with leader lines\n  \\draw[thin] (0.9,1.3) -- (0.9,2.4) node[above] {piston, area $2.0$ cm$^2$};\n  \\draw[thin] (6.4,0.55) -- (6.4,-0.6) node[below] {nozzle, area $0.080$ cm$^2$};\n  \\draw[thin] (6.95,1.1) -- (7.6,1.9) node[above right] {stopper};\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n```\n",
 "source": "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6, font=\\sffamily]\n  % barrel of the water gun\n  \\draw[thick] (0,0.3) rectangle (6,1.3);\n  % water inside the barrel\n  \\dotregion{1.05}{0.35}{5.95}{1.25}\n\n  % piston at the back of the barrel\n  \\fill[black!60] (0.8,0.3) rectangle (1.05,1.3);\n  % piston rod to the trigger\n  \\draw[thick] (0.9,0.8) -- (-1,0.8);\n  \\fill (0.9,0.8) circle (2pt);\n\n  % force on the trigger, label above the arrow\n  \\draw[->, thick] (-2.4,0.8) -- (-1,0.8) node[above, pos=0.5] {$5.0$ N};\n  \\draw[thin] (-2.4,0.8) -- (-2.4,-0.6) node[below] {trigger};\n\n  % narrow nozzle with stopper\n  \\draw[thick] (6,0.55) rectangle (6.8,1.05);\n  \\fill[black!50] (6.8,0.5) rectangle (7,1.1);\n  \\fill (6.9,0.8) circle (2pt);\n\n  % labels with leader lines\n  \\draw[thin] (0.9,1.3) -- (0.9,2.4) node[above] {piston, area $2.0$ cm$^2$};\n  \\draw[thin] (6.4,0.55) -- (6.4,-0.6) node[below] {nozzle, area $0.080$ cm$^2$};\n  \\draw[thin] (6.95,1.1) -- (7.6,1.9) node[above right] {stopper};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
